          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "G\u1EEDi website n\u00E0y cho cha m\u1EB9, \u00F4ng b\u00E0 qua Zalo ho\u1EB7c Facebook. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\u00E2n bi\u1EBFt tr\u01B0\u1EDBc l\u00E0 c\u00E1ch t\u1EF1 b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 t\u1ED1t nh\u1EA5t."
